# No environment variables need to be filled in for this project.
# The bridge and plugin do not load .env files.
# This file documents configuration; copying it to .env is optional and has no effect.
#
# Start the bridge with: npm start
# It generates fresh plugin/agent keys automatically on every startup.
# Paste the PLUGIN key printed in the terminal into the Figma plugin.
# The CLI reads its generated AGENT key from the ignored .local/agent.json file.
# Never put a real key in this template or commit .local/agent.json.
#
# Network address: 127.0.0.1:38475 (fixed; no HOST/PORT environment overrides).
# Optional Figma numeric plugin ID: npm run configure -- YOUR_NUMERIC_PLUGIN_ID
# No OpenAI API key, Figma API token, account email, or Windows username is required.
